  "content": "<p>拍了一年，剪了这条三分钟的短片，记录这座城市从清晨到深夜的光。</p>\n<video data-video-id=\"1300000000000000000\" poster=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-05fe05b84411fc88790189e95d7e84aa_1440w.png\"></video>\n<p>拍摄间隙的一些花絮：</p>\n<figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-05fe05b84411fc88790189e95d7e84aa_1440w.png\" data-rawwidth=\"720\"></figure>\n<p>年初拍的另一条短片也一并放出：</p>\n<a class=\"video-box\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/video/1300000000000000001\"><span class=\"video-box-label\">视频</span></a>\n<p>完整幕后和分镜脚本会陆续更新，欢迎留言交流。</p>",
